            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mishell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Recipe has a great taste and can be changed to suit needs &amp; taste.\nAdded a scoop of protein powder and more pineapple juice.\nLeft the white sugar out since the pineapple juice made it sweet enough.\nUsed low sugar OJ and instead of cow milk used almond milk.\nAlso used greek vanilla yogurt and added chai seeds\nOnly made these changes for a healthier me. made it the way the recipe is for the husband and he loved it.",
            "datePublished": "2020-05-07T11:16:58.403Z"
          },
          {
