              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Wendy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for my husband who is recovering from cancer and has been drinking a lot of smoothies lately. The only thing added to this recipe was some protein powder. We really enjoyed the sweetness of the strawberry and the tanginess of the pineapple. Definitely a keeper.",
